# SchoolDimes Part 2 -- Wallets: policy, savings, P2P, cards (Section C)
# VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client). Click "Send Request".
# Prerequisites: stack running (docker compose up) and `python manage.py seed_demo`.
# IDs below are placeholders: look real ones up with the GET requests
# (e.g. GET {{baseUrl}}/students/ or /wallets/) and edit the @variables.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@password = pw123456
@parentEmail = parent1@schooldimes.test
@parent2Email = parent2@schooldimes.test
@adminEmail = admin@kampaladps.schooldimes.test
@merchantStaffEmail = shop@ntindabookshop.schooldimes.test
# JWTs captured from the login requests below (send those first):
@parentToken = {{parentLogin.response.body.access}}
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.access}}
@shopToken = {{shopLogin.response.body.access}}

@walletId = 1
@savingsWalletId = 2
@studentId = 1
@recipientStudentId = 3
@cardId = 1
@policyId = 1
@alertId = 1
@goalId = 1

### Log in as parent1 (guardian of Amina + Brian)
# @name parentLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{parentEmail}}", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Log in as the Kampala school admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Product categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/product-categories/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### Create a category (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/product-categories/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Fruit", "is_unhealthy": false}

### Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/?active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### Create a product (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Banana", "category": 1, "price": "200"}

### Policies (school default + overrides) as admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/policies/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Tighten the school default (admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"daily_spend_cap": "6000", "p2p_daily_cap": "3000"}

### Parent creates an override for their child (tighten only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"student": {{studentId}}, "daily_spend_cap": "3000", "blocked_categories": [3]}

### Parent tries to LOOSEN -> 400 policy_cannot_loosen
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"student": {{studentId}}, "daily_spend_cap": "999999"}

### Effective policy for a student
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/effective-policy/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### Move 2,000 main -> savings
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/savings/move-in/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": "2000"}

### Move 500 savings -> main
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/savings/move-out/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": "500"}

### Savings goals with progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/savings-goals/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### Open a withdrawal window (guardian)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{savingsWalletId}}/savings/withdrawal-window/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"withdrawal_window_start": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "withdrawal_window_end": "2027-12-31T00:00:00Z"}

### Check the window
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{savingsWalletId}}/savings/withdrawal-window/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### Withdraw savings to mobile money (mock: 998 fails and is reversed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{savingsWalletId}}/savings/withdraw/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": "1000", "phone_number": "0772000111", "idempotency_key": "{{$guid}}"}

### P2P transfer (guardian of the sender)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/transfer/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sender_student": {{studentId}}, "recipient_student": {{recipientStudentId}}, "amount": "500", "note": "lunch money"}

### P2P history
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/p2p-history/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### P2P pattern alerts (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/p2p-alerts/?status=open
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Review an alert (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/p2p-alerts/{{alertId}}/review/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "reviewed", "review_notes": "Spoke to the class teacher"}

### My children's cards
GET {{baseUrl}}/cards/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### Freeze a card (notifies the other guardians)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}/freeze/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### Unfreeze
POST {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}/unfreeze/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### Report a card lost (then the admin reissues)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}/report-lost/
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### Reissue (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}/reissue/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pin": "2468"}
